  "metadata": {
    "title": "ARMBench Video Defect Dataset - corrected and additional annotations",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15873769",
    "publication_date": "2025-07-13",
    "description": "<p>The files accompany the paper \"<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/ECMR65884.2025.11162998\">Enhancing Video-Based Robot Failure Detection Using Task Knowledge</a>\" published at ECMR 2025. They include updated labels for the ARMBench Video Detect dataset, and additional annotations for the dataset, including object bounding boxes, temporal segmentation of robot actions, etc.</p>\n<p>The FAILURE.zip file contains temporal segmentation annotations for the FAILURE dataset.</p>",
